**Scoping/Multi-framework Safety:**
- ❌ **Flag hard-coded tag names** in CSS/TS files - use attribute notation instead:
  ```css
  /* BAD */
  ui5-button.accept-btn { color: green; }
  ```

C/C++: C++17; follow the existing formatting in the file to be consistent;
  use 4 spaces for indentation [...] No commented-out code.
- No new C/C++ macros. Use constexpr, templates, or inline functions.

